<h1 data-copy-en="Lindia" data-copy-zh="Lindia">Lindia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Dungeon recruitment, Training Room events and Elemental Stone." data-copy-zh="地下城招募、训练室事件与元素石。">Dungeon recruitment, Training Room events and Elemental Stone.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Scene_with_Whiskers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Elemental_Stone_Bond"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Close_Enough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Controlled_Magic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Victory_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_and_Recruiting_Lindia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Lindia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lindia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lindia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lindia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lindia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Lindia becomes available after the ordinary Dungeon’s floor-7 miniboss encounter recruits her. Afterwards she has Bar and Training Room schedules, a Mystic lesson, dates and Elemental Stone bonding.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Bar</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">04:00–08:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Training Room</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Her portrait requires her actual worker recruitment. For the destinations, recruit Brandy to open the Bar and build the Training Room with Gastoff. Her floor-7 recruitment can be earned before those rooms are available.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main_Story_Availability"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Complete the floor-7 battle; recruitment is granted on the victory route without an extra payment or affection requirement. Then progress through the Training Room events at Known (25), Friend (100) and Crush (400), with the two personal H2Hs available at Acquaintance (50) and Close Friend (200).</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Lindia at the Training Room</th><td data-label="Requirements">Training Room; 09:00–18:00; 12 recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Lindia +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Margin Notes</th><td data-label="Requirements">Training Room; 09:00–18:00; Lindia Known (25); Lindia at the Training Room; 12 recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Lindia +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Master Question</th><td data-label="Requirements">Training Room; 09:00–18:00; Lindia Friend (100); Margin Notes; 12 recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Lindia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Apprentice No More</th><td data-label="Requirements">Training Room; 09:00–18:00; Lindia Crush (400); The Master Question; 12 recruited</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Lindia +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Shape She Changed</th><td data-label="Requirements">Whiskers' Room; 16:00–18:00; A Sky With No Ceiling; 12 recruited; Whiskers, Lindia not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Whiskers +15; Lindia +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits.2C_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits,_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions_and_Spell_Control_Notes"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Lindia</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">The Bar / Training Room; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Book</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">The Bar / Training Room; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Book</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spell Control Notes</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Training Room; Friend (100); Mystic 35</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; keep 12 Energy and 5 Calm available; these resources are not consumed</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Mystic +1; 1 Wizard Clout; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Controlled Magic</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Training Room; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Close Enough</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Training Room; Close Friend (200); Controlled Magic</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Training Room; Friend (100); 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $75; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Training Room; In Love (3000); own Elemental Stone</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Elemental Stone level +1; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Spell Control Notes also grants 1 Wizard Clout. Elemental Stone bonding requires ownership of that stone and In Love (3000), costs 60 minutes once daily, and adds one stone level. Permanent training upgrades and resort activities are listed separately.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: permanent worker upgrades</summary><p>Each upgrade doubles the experience of its own training and adds +50% worker income. The two income bonuses add together. Carry the required crafted gift; it is consumed.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Conditions / start time</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Reward</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No Correct Answer</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Training Room; Lindia In Love (3000); Apprentice No More; Lindia: Close Enough; Lindia not on vacation; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Void-Kissed Charm</td><td data-label="Reward">permanent training upgrade; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Unwritten Method</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Training Room; Lindia In Love (3000); Apprentice No More; Lindia: Close Enough; Lindia not on vacation; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Reward">permanent training upgrade; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Optional reference: resort activities</summary><p>Assign her to vacation through Worker Rooms first. Resort portraits are rolled on arrival, so she is not guaranteed at every stop. Use the resort-specific menu while she is there.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Place / hours</th><th scope="col">Time / reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Place / hours">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">15 min; +1 base affection; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eat together</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Buffet 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relax together</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private beach time</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; +50 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spa evening</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Spa 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset walk H2H</th><td data-label="Place / hours">Sirena Isle Beach 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Time / reward / limit">60 min; 1/day, repeatable on later days</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort access and shared rewards</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Intelligence 80; Mystic 80; Communication 80</p><p>Favorite skill: Wizardry</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Ordinary dungeon recruitment and Bar relationship visits are different steps. For a missing portrait, confirm she is actually recruited.</li><li>Talk and Book gifts are available at both the Bar and Training Room and share their normal daily limits. The Mystic lesson, H2Hs, date and stone bonding begin in the Training Room.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-brandy.html">Brandy and Bar access</a></li><li><a href="character-gastoff.html">Gastoff and the Training Room</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Ordinary Dungeon</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Workers and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Scene_with_Whiskers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elemental_Stone_Bond"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Bazaar_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Close_Enough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Controlled_Magic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Victory_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_and_Recruiting_Lindia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Lindia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lindia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Lindia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/lindia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Lindia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Lindia 通过普通地下城第 7 层的小首领遭遇加入，之后会在酒吧与训练室活动，提供神秘属性课程、约会及元素石羁绊。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">酒吧</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">04:00–08:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">训练室</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table><p>她的肖像要求真正完成员工招募。地点入口方面，招募 Brandy 开放酒吧，训练室则由 Gastoff 建造；第 7 层招募进度可以先取得，不要求这些房间已经可用。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main_Story_Availability"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>完成第 7 层战斗，胜利路线会招募她，没有额外付款或好感度要求。之后可依次推进训练室中已知（25）、朋友（100）、迷恋（400）的个人事件，并在相识（50）与亲密朋友（200）阶段进行两段个人谈心。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">训练室里的 Lindia</th><td data-label="条件">训练室; 09:00–18:00; 12 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Lindia +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">页边笔记</th><td data-label="条件">训练室; 09:00–18:00; Lindia 已知 (25); 训练室里的 Lindia; 12 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Lindia +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">导师之问</th><td data-label="条件">训练室; 09:00–18:00; Lindia 朋友 (100); 页边笔记; 12 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Lindia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不再是学徒</th><td data-label="条件">训练室; 09:00–18:00; Lindia 迷恋 (400); 导师之问; 12 已招募</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Lindia +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她改变的形态</th><td data-label="条件">Whiskers 的房间; 16:00–18:00; 无顶之空; 12 已招募; Whiskers, Lindia 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Whiskers +15; Lindia +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits.2C_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits,_Gifts_and_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Actions_and_Spell_Control_Notes"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Lindia 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">酒吧／训练室; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 4次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送书</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">酒吧／训练室; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 书</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">法术控制笔记</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">训练室; 朋友 (100); 神秘 35</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟；基础可用量要求 12 精力、5 镇定，这两项不会扣除</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 神秘 +1; 1 巫师声望; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">可控的魔法</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">训练室; 相识 (50)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −20 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">足够亲近</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">训练室; 亲密朋友 (200); 可控的魔法</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −25 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">集市约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">训练室; 朋友 (100); 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $75; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">训练室; 恋爱中 (3000); 持有元素之石</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">元素之石等级 +1；1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>法术控制笔记还会增加 1 巫师声望。元素石羁绊要求持有该石并达到恋爱中（3000），每天可花 60 分钟提升 1 级石头等级。永久训练升级与度假行动另列于各表。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：永久员工升级</summary><p>每项升级使对应训练的经验翻倍，并增加 50% 员工收入；两项收入加成相加。需携带指定的制作礼物，并会消耗礼物。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">没有标准答案</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">训练室; Lindia 恋爱中 (3000); 不再是学徒; Lindia: 足够亲近; Lindia 未在度假; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 虚吻护符</td><td data-label="奖励">永久训练升级；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">尚未写下的方法</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">训练室; Lindia 恋爱中 (3000); 不再是学徒; Lindia: 足够亲近; Lindia 未在度假; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 棱彩法术胸针</td><td data-label="奖励">永久训练升级；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>可选查阅：度假村活动</summary><p>先通过员工房间安排她度假。抵达度假地点时才判定遇见谁，并非每次都能见到她。在那里遇见时，请使用度假专用菜单。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">活动</th><th scope="col">地点／时段</th><th scope="col">耗时／奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／时段">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">15 分钟；基础好感度 +1；6次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起用餐</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛自助餐 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起放松</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滩私人相聚</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；基础好感度 +50；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜间水疗</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛水疗馆 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步谈心</th><td data-label="地点／时段">塞壬岛海滩 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="耗时／奖励／次数">60 分钟；1次/日，可在之后的日子重复</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村入口与共同奖励</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>智力 80; 神秘 80; 沟通 80</p><p>偏好技能：巫术</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>地下城招募与酒吧探访是不同步骤；肖像缺失时，请先确认已经真正招募。</li><li>酒吧与训练室都可交谈、送书，并共用各行动的常规每日次数；神秘课程、谈心、约会与灵魂石羁绊则从训练室开始。</li></ul></section>
